# =============================================================================
# MULEGUARD .gitattributes
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Purpose:
# - Normalize line endings safely across Windows, macOS, and Linux
# - Force LF for Unix/Python/Docker/shell files
# - Force CRLF for Windows batch/PowerShell files
# - Keep Makefiles tab-safe
# - Mark binary/generated artifacts correctly
# - Reduce noisy diffs for lockfiles, caches, reports, ML artifacts, and data
# - Avoid committing or diffing secrets, databases, and model binaries
#
# After changing this file, renormalize existing files with:
#   git add .gitattributes
#   git add --renormalize .
#   git commit -m "chore: normalize line endings and binary attributes"
# =============================================================================


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default normalization
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
